 here.","D":"The direct complement is a base verb, not -ing."}}},{"id":"b0e376ac-890b-5c56-a778-ff2a7e064340","topicSlug":"unreal-subjunctive","level":"C1","prompt":"The task is due now. Use the “it is time” past-form pattern: “It is time we ____ the old portrait.”","choices":[{"id":"A","text":"restoring"},{"id":"B","text":"to restore"},{"id":"C","text":"restored"},{"id":"D","text":"will restore"}],"answerId":"C","hint":"The past form expresses that the action is **due now**, not that it already happened.","explanation":"The pattern **it is time + subject + past form** uses **restored** for an action due now.","keywords":["time-unreal-past"],"skill":"time-unreal-past","contextKey":"unreal-subjunctive-2","fingerprint":"37b2c7f94ff42e10287044ef6b1b1959a4bafd638ea8fd4ff2805d61a32a8f24","source":"seed","provenance":{"kind":"original-guidance-aligned","referenceIds":["bc-unreal"],"version":"core-2026-09-v3","reviewStatus":"automated-checked; educator-review-pending"},"teaching":{"steps":["The past form expresses that the action is **due now**, not that it already happened.","The pattern **it is time + subject + past form** uses **restored** for an action due now.","Choose **restored**. Read the complete sentence again and check both its form and its intended meaning."],"choiceReasons":{"A":"An -ing form alone does not form the finite clause.","B":"After the stated subject we, this pattern needs a finite past form.","C":"The pattern **it is time + subject + past form** uses **restored** for an action due now.","D":"The requested it-is-time construction uses a past form, not will."}}},{"id":"815e6e27-d148-5403-ac46-735bfe1c1159","topicSlug":"unreal-subjunctive","level":"C1","prompt":"Use the formal mandative subjunctive: “They recommend that she ____ the garden fence today.”","choices":[{"id":"A","text":"measure"},{"id":"B","text":"measures"},{"id":"C","text":"measured"},{"id":"D","text":"to measure"}],"answerId":"A","hint":"The clause expresses a **recommendation**, and the requested form is the **subjunctive**.","explanation":"The requested subjunctive uses base **measure**, without third-person -s.","keywords":["mandative-base"],"skill":"mandative-base","contextKey":"unreal-subjunctive-3","fingerprint":"07dabe0d887bf87fa8eaee5e2b06c312ad26b17ed991477c156fc2e53fac8bb8","source":"seed","provenance":{"kind":"original-guidance-aligned","referenceIds":["bc-unreal"],"version":"core-2026-09-v3","reviewStatus":"automated-checked; educator-review-pending"},"teaching":{"steps":["The clause expresses a **recommendation**, and the requested form is the **subjunctive**.","The requested subjunctive uses base **measure**, without third-person -s.","Choose **measure**. Read the complete sentence again and check both its form and its intended meaning."],"choiceReasons":{"A":"The requested subjunctive uses base **measure**, without third-person -s.","B":"This is ordinary indicative agreement, not the explicitly requested subjunctive form.","C":"The subjunctive here uses a base form, not past tense.","D":"A finite that-clause in this pattern does not use a to-infinitive."}}},{"id":"756581b6-7653-5bab-aced-6c54d203f7e6","topicSlug":"unreal-subjunctive","level":"C1","prompt":"Use a negative mandative subjunctive: “They insist that she ____ the garden fence without permission.”","choices":[{"id":"A","text":"not measures"},{"id":"B","text":"not to measure"},{"id":"C","text":"not measure"},{"id":"D","text":"does not measure"}],"answerId":"C","hint":"A mandative negative places **not directly before the base verb**.","explanation":"The negative subjunctive is **not + base measure**, without does.","keywords":["negative-subjunctive"],"skill":"negative-subjunctive","contextKey":"unreal-subjunctive-3","fingerprint":"26149c8fd60879474fec2f8ab4e8307859968c504df1def1f81a7291231e59e7","source":"seed","provenance":{"kind":"original-guidance-aligned","referenceIds":["bc-unreal"],"version":"core-2026-09-v3","reviewStatus":"automated-checked; educator-review-pending